        "created_at": "2014-03-17T17:32:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"EvanDan55\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/48/2374_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> EvanDan55:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just kidding, I'm 100% terrified of needles.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I honestly can't give blood or get a shot at the doctors without passing out. Happens like clockwork. But for some reason I'v never had an issue getting any of my art done. Maybe it's just a visual trigger for me of that needle sticking out of my skin, not sure. For some reason, tattoo needles are just a much different beast (thank jebus)</p>",
