        "name": "Craig",
        "username": "Craig",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-17T18:18:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>EvanDan55 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Just kidding, I'm 100% terrified of needles.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI honestly can't give blood or get a shot at the doctors without passing out. Happens like clockwork. But for some reason I'v never had an issue getting any of my art done. Maybe it's just a visual trigger for me of that needle sticking out of my skin, not sure. For some reason, tattoo needles are just a much different beast (thank jebus)\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I also am terrified of needles. But, for some reason, I love getting inked. I think it's because it doesn't seem like a needle.</p>\n<p>Also, I would give blood, were it legal, in a… wait for it… heartbeat.</p>",
